> ***
. * This group DID vote (rr_vote observed), but is missing on >=1 of the three
. * core independent variables (male_pol_lead, trad_bwnorm, gay_father). Becaus
> e
. * their vote choice is known, we can test directly whether item non-response
. * on the attitude battery is related to actual PRR support.
. 
. capture drop coreiv_missing

. gen coreiv_missing = missing(male_pol_lead) | missing(trad_bwnorm) | missing(
> gay_father)

. 
. capture drop coreiv_group

. gen coreiv_group = .
(28,963 missing values generated)

. replace coreiv_group = 0 if estimation_sample == 1
(14,963 real changes made)

. replace coreiv_group = 1 if !missing(rr_vote) & prr_available == 1 & coreiv_m
> issing == 1
(1,108 real changes made)

. 
. label define civg_lbl 0 "Included (Analytic Sample)" 1 "Excluded (Missing Cor
> e IV, but Voted)"

. label values coreiv_group civg_lbl

